/**
 * Hail Hermes — Wrist pane for Hermes Desktop (try the watch path without hardware).
 *
 * Pairing + hold-to-talk use the same Hail Hermes WebSocket as a watch (`kind: desktop`, protocol v2).
 * Dashboard routes (`ctx.rest`) proxy hub control for pending devices and the bundled sample WAV.
 *
 * Plain ESM: jsx() only; imports limited to @hermes/plugin-sdk, react, react/jsx-runtime.
 */

